      "description": "Ocean-teal action on coral with a deep-teal keyboard outline.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-closing\"><a class=\"ds-button ds-light ds-icon\" href=\"#example\">Explore Bali with me<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div>",
